# vendored third-party sources (robot.repos / vcs import) — git-untracked by
# design: check_test_integrity.py classifies them "unowned" so they are not
# required to produce tests, and they must never be accidentally committed.
# (PR8b: mujoco_vendor + mujoco_ros2_control stack.) Their pinned commits are
# captured in robot.repos, not by vendoring the trees into this repo.
src/mujoco_vendor/
src/mujoco_ros2_control/
